  "problem": "",
  "worked_solution": "We substitute $x=-2$ and then evaluate the absolute value before we simplify the rest of the expression:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|{x}^{3}-x|+2x & = \\\\ |(-2)^{3}-(-2)|+2(-2) & = \\\\ |-8+2|-4 & = \\\\ |-6|-4 & = \\\\ 6-4 & = \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}\n$$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
